# ===================================================================
# Sneha Rajput Portfolio - Environment Configuration
# ===================================================================
# To configure real email delivery to your inbox:
# 1. Copy this file to a new file named .env.local in the project root:
#    cp .env.example .env.local
# 2. Add your free access key below.
#
# NOTE: .env.local is ignored by Git and will never be committed.
# ===================================================================

# 1. Configurable Contact Email
# Defaults to sneharajput.work@gmail.com if not specified.
VITE_CONTACT_EMAIL=sneharajput.work@gmail.com

# 2. Email Delivery Service (Choose ONE):
#
# OPTION A: Web3Forms (Recommended - Free, direct to Gmail, zero backend required)
# 1. Visit: https://web3forms.com
# 2. Enter your real Gmail address and click "Create Access Key".
# 3. Paste the access key received in your email inbox below:
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=

# OPTION B: Formspree (Alternative form service)
# 1. Create a free form at https://formspree.io
# 2. Paste your Form ID or full endpoint URL below:
# VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=

# OPTION C: Custom Backend API Endpoint
# If you run a custom Express server or serverless endpoint:
# VITE_CONTACT_API_URL=
